cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FE-E or this experimental package, please cite this preprint."
title: "FE-E: Finite-Element and Entropy Control of Adjoint Propagation in Deep Transformers"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: WANG
    given-names: XUEZHENG
version: 0.1
date-released: 2026-08-07
repository-code: "https://github.com/supergitty520/fe-e-transformer-research"
url: "https://github.com/supergitty520/fe-e-transformer-research"
abstract: >-
  FE-E treats task-loss gradients with respect to Transformer residual states
  as a finite-element adjoint field over depth and controls its stiffness,
  mass energy, and mesh-relative entropy.
